-- Lobe weights: 0.3 (backward/negative $g$) and 0.7 (forward/positive $g$) [S1, unofficial].
-- Asymmetry scaling: $g_1 = -0.1c$, $g_2 = 0.3c$ [S1, unofficial].
-- Attenuation decay: $a$ multiplies by 0.2 per octave [S1, unofficial].
